{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02230",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.02,
      "end_seconds": 6.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "So, hi, doctor, I came as soon as they called me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.79,
      "end_seconds": 11.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.49,
      "end_seconds": 19.65,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Hello, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 20.62,
      "end_seconds": 23.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "She's been having a headache, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.82,
      "end_seconds": 29.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right, rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.14,
      "end_seconds": 32.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.28,
      "end_seconds": 35.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.38,
      "end_seconds": 58.14,
      "duration_seconds": 18.76,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get a severe painful red eye as well. As for severe painful red eye, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.76,
      "end_seconds": 63.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Alright, is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.22,
      "end_seconds": 70.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Well, it's... hard to say, it's kind of... I don't know—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.38,
      "end_seconds": 77.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Take your time. Mild, moderate, or severe, if you had to pick?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.42,
      "end_seconds": 83.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "I'd give it a four, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.78,
      "end_seconds": 86.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "How often do you get it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.94,
      "end_seconds": 89.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "It happens all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.12,
      "end_seconds": 93.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Have you noticed any triggers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.77,
      "end_seconds": 104.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.08,
      "text": "I notice it more with dim light. Oh, and being sick. That's been about the same, about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.7,
      "end_seconds": 128.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Let me check a a few things. Any injury, discharge or contact lens?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.67,
      "end_seconds": 143.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.77,
      "text": "No, no injury, no discharge, no contact lens. I did have blurred vision with halos at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.0,
      "end_seconds": 147.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.45,
      "end_seconds": 151.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.58,
      "end_seconds": 164.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.18,
      "end_seconds": 168.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "no, nothing at the moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.9,
      "end_seconds": 174.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.9,
      "end_seconds": 179.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "My daughter has type 1 diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.37,
      "end_seconds": 185.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Okay, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.47,
      "end_seconds": 192.63,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "Yes, depression. Let me think, I've had eczema for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.38,
      "end_seconds": 203.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear so, anything you do to stay fit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.46,
      "end_seconds": 207.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.55,
      "end_seconds": 212.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.72,
      "end_seconds": 215.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No surgery, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.59,
      "end_seconds": 221.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.77,
      "end_seconds": 225.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "Mm, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 227.36,
      "end_seconds": 234.47,
      "duration_seconds": 7.11,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to amoxicillin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.87,
      "end_seconds": 237.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.3,
      "end_seconds": 242.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "fair enough, I'll write down both versions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 246.89,
      "end_seconds": 254.33,
      "duration_seconds": 7.44,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Heart rate 69, BP is 116 over 69, SpO2 98 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.19,
      "end_seconds": 257.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "good, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.05,
      "end_seconds": 262.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.26,
      "end_seconds": 265.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.53,
      "end_seconds": 281.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "the right eye is red, the pupil is fixed and mid-sized, and the eye feels rock hard"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.62,
      "end_seconds": 317.1,
      "duration_seconds": 29.48,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Okay, thinking it through, I'd lean towards acute angle-closure glaucoma. A severe infection is still possible. I want an urgent eye pressure check done, that's for acute glaucoma. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. The treatment will be acetazolamide, 500 milligrams, now, single dose. That's for acute glaucoma. This is a sight-threatening emergency, I am sending you to the eye casualty now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.48,
      "end_seconds": 340.37,
      "duration_seconds": 21.89,
      "text": "I'd like you to see the eye emergency service as well, and I'll write the referral. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. I'd like to see you again straight away. Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.93,
      "end_seconds": 344.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.6,
      "end_seconds": 348.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}